<section class="own-records"><div class="container ownership-spread"><div class="ownership-art" aria-hidden="true"><div id="privacy-animation"><svg class="privacy-fallback" viewBox="0 0 160 160" hidden><path d="M49 69V50a31 31 0 0 1 62 0v19" fill="none" stroke="#e67e26" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="34" y="65" width="92" height="70" rx="12" fill="#e67e26"/><circle cx="80" cy="94" r="8" fill="#121212"/><path d="M80 99v13" stroke="#121212" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><noscript><svg viewBox="0 0 160 160"><path d="M49 69V50a31 31 0 0 1 62 0v19" fill="none" stroke="#e67e26" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="34" y="65" width="92" height="70" rx="12" fill="#e67e26"/><circle cx="80" cy="94" r="8" fill="#121212"/><path d="M80 99v13" stroke="#121212" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></noscript></div></div><div><h2>Your records.<br>Your control.</h2><p>Start without an account. Work offline. No ads, no bank connection, no access to your messages.</p><p>Want your records on another device? Choose automatic cloud sync to keep your records up to date across devices.</p><a href="/privacy/">How Kaasi handles your data</a></div></div></section>
<section class="faq-band" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="container"><h2 id="faq-title">A few things to know.</h2><div class="faq-list"><details name="kaasi-faq"><summary>Is Kaasi free?<span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>Yes. Kaasi is free to use, with every current feature included. Voluntary donations support development.</p></details><details name="kaasi-faq"><summary>Does Kaasi work offline?<span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>Yes. You can record and review your finances offline. An internet connection is needed for initial setup, updates and optional cloud sync.</p></details><details name="kaasi-faq"><summary>Can I install Kaasi on my phone or computer?<span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>Yes. Install Kaasi from a supported browser to open it like an app. We recommend Google Chrome for the best installation experience. No app store is required.</p></details><details name="kaasi-faq"><summary>Does Kaasi connect to my bank?<span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>No. You enter and manage your records yourself. Kaasi does not access your bank account or read your messages. We respect your privacy: your private banking details and messages stay private.</p></details><details name="kaasi-faq"><summary>Can I track Sri Lankan rupees, credit cards and debts?<span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>Yes. Kaasi supports tracking in LKR, with cash and bank accounts, budgets, credit cards, debts, receivables and installments.</p></details><details name="kaasi-faq"><summary>Do I need an account?<span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>No account is needed for local tracking. Google sign-in is available for optional cloud sync across devices.</p></details><details name="kaasi-faq"><summary>Can I export and back up my records?<span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>Yes. Export your records as a JSON backup and import them into Kaasi when needed. You can also export monthly PDF reports. Keep backups somewhere safe, especially before clearing browser data or changing devices.</p></details><details name="kaasi-faq"><summary>Can I track subscriptions and upcoming payments?<span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>Yes. Keep track of recurring subscriptions and their renewals, and review upcoming payments so you can plan for what is due next.</p></details><details name="kaasi-faq"><summary>What happens if I clear my browser data or change devices?<span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary><p>Clearing browser data can remove records stored on that device. Export a JSON backup before clearing data or changing devices, then import it into Kaasi when needed. If you use optional cloud sync, sign in on your other device to sync your cloud records. Clearing local browser data does not delete your cloud copy.</p></details></div></div></section>
